5.7 Retrodiction benchmark (01E)

Using the frozen model from 01B and era-fixed policy assignment, compare predicted to observed propagation ratios for both targets. Report the ratio, agreement with \tau_{\text{retro}}, and sensitivity to multiverse axes. A model that passes H0 but fails 01E on additional documented disruptions is reported as narrowly retrodictive, and the scope of confirmatory claims is reduced.

